#. module: account_reconcile_sale_order_no_invoice
#: model:mail.template,body_html:account_reconcile_sale_order_no_invoice.sale_order_paid_mail_template
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px\">\n"
"                <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px\">\n"
"                    Hello,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    The sale order <b t-out=\"object.name\"/> has been marked as\n"
"                    paid during a bank reconciliation.\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"statement_line\" t-value=\"ctx.get('sale_order_paid_statement_line')\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"statement_line\">\n"
"                        The payment has been registered from the bank\n"
"                        transaction \"<t t-out=\"ctx.get('sale_order_paid_reference')\"/>\" of <t t-out=\"format_date(statement_line.date)\"/>\n"
"                        (amount <t t-out=\"format_amount(statement_line.amount, statement_line.currency_id)\"/>).\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    The payment will be reconciled with the invoice once the\n"
"                    sale order is invoiced.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <a t-attf-href=\"{{object.get_base_url()}}/odoo/orders/{{object.id}}\" target=\"_blank\">Sale order</a>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px\">\n"
"                <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px\">\n"
"                    Bonjour,\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    La commande <b t-out=\"object.name\"/> a été marquée comme\n"
"                    payée lors d'un rapprochement bancaire.\n"
"                    <t t-set=\"statement_line\" t-value=\"ctx.get('sale_order_paid_statement_line')\"/>\n"
"                    <t t-if=\"statement_line\">\n"
"                        Le paiement a été enregistré à partir de la\n"
"                        transaction bancaire « <t t-out=\"ctx.get('sale_order_paid_reference')\"/> » du <t t-out=\"format_date(statement_line.date)\"/>\n"
"                        (montant <t t-out=\"format_amount(statement_line.amount, statement_line.currency_id)\"/>).\n"
"                    </t>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    Le paiement sera rapproché de la facture lorsque la\n"
"                    commande sera facturée.\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <br/>\n"
"                    <a t-attf-href=\"{{object.get_base_url()}}/odoo/orders/{{object.id}}\" target=\"_blank\">Commande</a>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        \n"

#. module: account_reconcile_sale_order_no_invoice
#: model:ir.model,name:account_reconcile_sale_order_no_invoice.model_account_bank_statement_line
msgid "Bank Statement Line"
msgstr "Ligne de relevé bancaire"

#. module: account_reconcile_sale_order_no_invoice
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_reconcile_sale_order_no_invoice.res_config_settings_view_form_sale_order_payment_reconcile
msgid "Behaviour when a bank statement line is reconciled against a sale order (chosen in the \"Sales orders\" tab of the reconciliation widget or matched by a sale order reconciliation rule): either register the payment on the order without invoicing it, or invoice the order at reconciliation (OCA account_reconcile_sale_order behaviour)."
msgstr "Comportement lorsqu'une ligne de relevé bancaire est rapprochée d'une commande client (choix effectué dans l'onglet « Commandes clients » du widget de rapprochement ou détection automatique par une règle de rapprochement de commandes clients) : soit enregistrer le paiement sur la commande sans la facturer, soit facturer la commande lors du rapprochement (comportement du module OCA account_reconcile_sale_order)."

#. module: account_reconcile_sale_order_no_invoice
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_reconcile_sale_order_no_invoice.field_res_company__account_reconcile_sale_order_mode
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_reconcile_sale_order_no_invoice.field_res_config_settings__account_reconcile_sale_order_mode
msgid ""
"Behaviour when a bank statement line is reconciled against a sale order (selected manually in the \"Sales orders\" tab or matched automatically by a sale_order_matching rule).\n"
"- Register the payment on the sale order: no invoice is created, a receivable counterpart journal item labelled with the sale order name is created and linked to the order, which is marked as paid.\n"
"- Invoice the sale order at reconciliation: the sale order is invoiced and the created invoice is reconciled with the payment (OCA account_reconcile_sale_order behaviour)."
msgstr ""
"Comportement lorsqu'une ligne de relevé bancaire est rapprochée d'une commande client (sélection manuelle dans l'onglet « Commandes clients » ou détection automatique par une règle sale_order_matching).\n"
"- Enregistrer le paiement sur la commande client : aucune facture n'est créée, une écriture de contrepartie au compte client, libellée avec le nom de la commande, est créée et liée à la commande, qui est marquée comme payée.\n"
"- Facturer la commande client au rapprochement : la commande est facturée et la facture créée est rapprochée du paiement (comportement du module OCA account_reconcile_sale_order)."

